    "Automatic mounting is off, so your shared folders are not mounted for you after sign-in or network changes.": {
      "comment": "Main window rework (FR-027..FR-031). Draft translations need native review.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic mounting is off, so your shared folders are not mounted for you after sign-in or network changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动挂载已关闭，因此登录或网络变化后不会为你挂载共享文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動掛載已關閉，因此登入或網路變化後不會為你掛載共享檔案夾。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動マウントがオフのため、サインインやネットワークの変化後に共有フォルダは自動でマウントされません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "자동 마운트가 꺼져 있어 로그인이나 네트워크 변화 후 공유 폴더가 자동으로 마운트되지 않습니다."
