          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique o endereço. Ele deve ser um endereço smb://host/share completo, sem credenciais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the network connection. Automnt waits for a network or sign-in change before trying again.": {
      "comment": "Main window rework (FR-027..FR-031). Draft translations need native review.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the network connection. Automnt waits for a network or sign-in change before trying again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查网络连接。Automnt 会等待网络或登录状态变化后再尝试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查網路連線。Automnt 會等待網路或登入狀態變化後再嘗試。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ネットワーク接続を確認してください。Automnt はネットワークまたはサインインの変化を待ってから再試行します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "네트워크 연결을 확인하세요. Automnt는 네트워크나 로그인 상태가 바뀌면 다시 시도합니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe die Netzwerkverbindung. Automnt wartet auf eine Netzwerk- oder Anmeldeänderung, bevor es erneut versucht."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez la connexion réseau. Automnt attend un changement de réseau ou de session avant de réessayer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba la conexión de red. Automnt espera un cambio de red o de sesión antes de volver a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique a conexão de rede. O Automnt aguarda uma mudança de rede ou de login antes de tentar novamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the server address and mount folder. Each shared folder needs a distinct address and folder on this server.": {
      "comment": "Main window rework (FR-027..FR-031). Draft translations need native review.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the server address and mount folder. Each shared folder needs a distinct address and folder on this server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查服务器地址和挂载文件夹。此服务器上的每个共享文件夹都需要不同的地址和文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查伺服器位址和掛載檔案夾。此伺服器上的每個共享檔案夾都需要不同的位址和檔案夾。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバアドレスとマウントフォルダを確認してください。このサーバでは共有フォルダごとに別のアドレスとフォルダが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "서버 주소와 마운트 폴더를 확인하세요. 이 서버에서는 공유 폴더마다 다른 주소와 폴더가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe Serveradresse und Einbindungsordner. Jeder freigegebene Ordner benötigt auf diesem Server eine eigene Adresse und einen eigenen Ordner."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez l’adresse du serveur et le dossier de montage. Chaque dossier partagé nécessite une adresse et un dossier distincts sur ce serveur."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba la dirección del servidor y la carpeta de montaje. Cada carpeta compartida necesita una dirección y una carpeta distintas en este servidor."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique o endereço do servidor e a pasta de montagem. Cada pasta compartilhada precisa de um endereço e uma pasta distintos neste servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the server and your sign-in, then try mounting this shared folder again.": {
