    "While automatic mounting is off, you can still mount a shared folder from its row. Ejecting there needs app background control; otherwise eject it in Finder.": {
      "comment": "User Guide sentence; draft translations require native review.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While automatic mounting is off, you can still mount a shared folder from its row. Ejecting there needs app background control; otherwise eject it in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动挂载关闭时，你仍可在共享文件夹所在行单独挂载。直接弹出需要应用后台控制；否则请在 Finder 中弹出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動掛載關閉時，你仍可在共享資料夾所在列單獨掛載。直接退出需要應用程式背景控制；否則請在 Finder 中退出。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動マウントがオフでも、共有フォルダの行から個別にマウントできます。その場での取り出しにはアプリのバックグラウンド制御が必要です。ない場合は Finder で取り出してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "자동 마운트가 꺼져 있어도 공유 폴더 행에서 개별 마운트할 수 있습니다. 해당 위치에서 추출하려면 앱 백그라운드 제어가 필요하며, 없으면 Finder에서 추출하십시오."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auch wenn das automatische Einbinden aus ist, kannst du einen freigegebenen Ordner in seiner Zeile einzeln einbinden. Zum Auswerfen dort ist die Hintergrundsteuerung der App nötig; sonst wirf ihn im Finder aus."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Même si le montage automatique est désactivé, vous pouvez monter un dossier partagé depuis sa ligne. L’éjection à cet endroit nécessite le contrôle en arrière-plan de l’app ; sinon, éjectez-le dans le Finder."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aunque el montaje automático esté desactivado, puedes montar una carpeta compartida desde su fila. Para expulsarla ahí se necesita el control en segundo plano de la app; si no, expúlsala en el Finder."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mesmo com a montagem automática desativada, você pode montar uma pasta compartilhada na linha dela. Para ejetar ali é preciso o controle em segundo plano do app; caso contrário, ejete no Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close the window with unsaved changes?": {
